    <briefdescription>
<para>Iterator for <ref refid="" kindref="compound">bitset</ref> objects with expression support. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="" kindref="compound">bitset_iterator</ref> is used to iterate over a result of the evaluation a <ref refid="" kindref="compound">logical expression </ref> on a set of bitsets. The iterator evaluates its expression on the fly, without producing temporary bitsets. Each iteration (<ref refid="" kindref="compound">bitset_iterator_next</ref>) returns the next position where a given expression evaluates to true on a given set of bitsets.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="expr_8h" kindref="compound">expr.h</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
